# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Mortal Kombat: Deadly Alliance (4D57000C), classifier-path benchmark
# (#433): drive generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay
# itself once play is confirmed. 1-on-1 fighter: close the distance, attack
# -- never START.
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    axis LX min
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    mash A 3 0.25
    wait 0.5
    mash X 2 0.25
    wait 1.0
}
